---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
needsGallery: false
---
<div class="hero-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">photography · amsterdam</p>
  <h1>{{ site.name }}</h1>
</div>

<div class="intro-cols">
  <!-- TODO: replace this placeholder bio -->
  <p>I photograph two worlds. Out in the field it's birds and other wildlife —
  herons in the polder, terns over the water, a robin holding still just long
  enough. Back inside it's a light microscope and whatever fits on a slide:
  diatoms, pollen, crystals.</p>
  <p>Different subjects, same habit of looking. The blog covers the gear, the
  technique and the lessons learned along the way.</p>
</div>

<div class="hero-full">
  {% for category in categories %}
    {% categoryDoor category %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="bstrip">
  <div class="bs-head">
    <h2>From the blog</h2>
    <a class="more" href="/blog/">all posts →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="bs-grid">
    {% for post in collections.postsByDate %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <a class="post" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="pd">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</div>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% if collections.postsByDate.length == 0 %}
      <p class="page-description">No posts yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
